    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KaAmoni Nahashi wenjili, wakuchikili Yabeshi Gileyadi. Antu amuYabeshi ejima hiyakumwila Nahashi, nawu, Kwataku chitiyaŋenu nanetu, twakakukalakelaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KaAmoni Nahashi hakuyila nindi, Tiyenu hitukutiyaŋena nenu, nami, Chipa niyilokola mesu achidiilu wejimawenu, kulonda niyisawishi nachu aIsarela ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akulumpi amuYabeshi hiyakumwila nawu, Atulekuku mafuku atanu nayedi, twakatemesha temeshiatuŋanda mwahita ŋinza jawaIsarela jejima. Neyi kwakabula wakutuhandisha twakenza kudeyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuŋanda hiyakushika kuGibeya kwadiŋi Sawulu, hiyakuleja antu nsaŋuoyu. Antu ejima avwakuka nimumakumbu akudila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chatiyiliyi nsaŋu oyu Spiritu yaNzambi hakwinza hadiSawulu naŋovu, hakuzuwa nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakukwata aŋombi ayedi, hakuyitetateta, hakutemesha kanti kanti nawatuŋanda mwahita ŋinza jawaIsarela jejima, nindi, Yowu wakabula kwinza nakulondela Sawulu naSamweli ŋombi jindi akajikoŋa chochochu. Woma waYehova hiwukuholokelahadi antu, hiyakunyamoka wejima wawu namuchima wumu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyichindila kuBezeki. Anyana kaIsarela ashikili mumakombakaji makulakaji asatu, aYuda makombakaji makumi asatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyila atuŋanda enjili, nindi, Tiyenu chimwakayila antu akuYabeshi Gileyadi, nenu, Kumadiki chimwakatiya mwaana busu, mwakapuluka. Atuŋanda hiyakufunta cheŋi, hiyakuyileja antu akuYabeshi, hiyakutiya kuwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akuYabeshi hiyakuyila akwawu nawu, Kumadiki twakenza kudenu mwakatu koŋi mwonsu mumwakatiyila kuwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikunachi Sawulu hakwambula antu yendu yisatu, hakwinza mukachi kachilombu hachilu chaha kwanza kana nakucha, hakuyitapa aAmoni, tape-e nimwaana busu. Asheluhu amwaŋala nindu-ndu, chakwila hela ayedi kwikala hamu nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu hiyakumwila Samweli nawu, Indi welili nindi, Sawulu bayi atuyulaŋa etuku, hinyi? Yiletenu awa antu, tuyijahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu nindi, Lelu kujaha muntu nehi; muloŋa lelu Yehova nakoŋi jakupulwisha muIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli hakuyila antu, nindi, Twatuyenu kuGiligali twakakoleshelukuwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ejima hiyakuya kuGiligali. Hiyakumudiishila Sawulu wanta kwenoku kuGiligali kumesu aYehova. Hiyakuketwilaku niyi muna yanyilambu yakuwunda kumesu aYehova. Kwenoku Sawulu nawaIsarela ejima azaŋaleli nankashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
